{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t港股窄幅上落，恒指半日高低點數波幅不足210點，臨近中午收市升幅擴大，半日收市報23193點，升100點，升幅0.44%。成交額逾930億元。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n科技指數報3857點，跌14點，跌幅0.37%。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n3桶油、本地地產及收租股、內房股都上升。AI大模型股、晶片股、黃金相關股份都向下。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：宋家樑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:34.312642+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T04:18:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:18:22.061588+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:31.618084+00:00","content_hash":"42df4db61ae7e1283359510819add1f3dc6a07bcde2b4b0c67b7b64b5595a45d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}